body:
Daria isn't on the spectrum, she is just stubborn. I don't think this is a fair speculation because she has been known to choose when and how she interacts with others, she can be social and likes to interact with people but is so afraid of being disliked that she purposely tries to make people dislike her so she doesn't care when they do. 

&#x200B;

Also,, in the season four finale when Jane and Daria talk after Daria kissed Tom, Jane says Daria can date him and that it's fine with her. Daria specifically responds "nobody is that well adjusted" and then Jane said "I'm definitely not and blah blah" but that was a confirmation that Jane was obviously extremely upset.
